READ ME for folder "fitting"
Author: Rebecca Chisholm, La Trobe University, 2026

Code in this folder was developed to 
- fit the variable response model to data from Asubende 
- fit the GR-only model to data from Asubende 
- run annual and biannual MDA scenarios
- plot figures in manuscript

Fitting_VR_model.R
Run this to fit variable response model to annual MDAi data from Asubende

Fitting_GR_only model.R
Run this to fit GR only model to annual MDAi data from Asubende.
Must be run after running Fitting_VR_model.R

Run_biannual_MDA_vr_model.R 
This runs annual and then biannual MDA for accepted posterior trajectories for the variable response model (with cumulative effect) for the original fitted model and the sensitivity analysis
Outputs: Final_posterior_burnins_plusbiannualMDAs_cumu.Rdata,
Final_posterior_burnins_plusbiannualMDAs_cumuSA.Rdata

Run_biannual_MDA_gr_model.R 
This runs annual and then biannual MDA for accepted posterior trajectories for the GR_only model (with cumulative effect)
Outputs: GR_only_model_final_stats.Rdata, GR_only_model_full_trajectory.Rdata

Figure_2.R
Run this to create figure 2 in manuscript and associated sensitivity analysis plot in supplementary
(Need to run all of the above scripts first if you don’t have the Rdata files generated from these scripts)

Create_supp_figures_and_tables.R
Run this to create Figures S1, S2, S3, S4, S6, S8 and matrices storing statistics for supp tables 2, 9

Other scripts that are necessary to run these scripts are:

fixed-parameters.R
Lists the values of parameters that are fixed in fitting process.  

equations.R
This script included functions 
- describing the equations of the model (with and without cumulative effect) 
- that calculate lags in the delay differential equations
- that calculate the mf prevalence from the mean mf load variables
- calculate selective effect of MDA on phenotype inheritance parameters

These are saved in "r_files" and are used in Fitting_VR_model.R 
(their functions are described in this script):
- Fitting_phenotype_parameters.R
- Create_burnins_from_posterior_samples.R
- Fitting_SOR_response_parameters_from_posterior_burnins.R
- Process_output.R


